# Mini App conventions

- Call only backend HTTPS APIs — no app secrets in client
- Auth via Zalo SDK → exchange for backend Sanctum token
- Teacher vs Parent routes/screens separated
- Vote flow uses invite token from link/QR only
- Handle states: already voted, quota full, form expired
- Keep UI minimal and fast for parents on mobile data
